WEBVTT

l1
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.500
She rose before the morning bell

l2
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:21.000
She read the orders through

l3
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.500
The corridor, the empty hall

l4
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:32.000
The work that no one else would do

l5
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:41.500
Dogtushya! Dogtushya!

l6
00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:47.000
Steady at the door

l7
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:52.500
Dogtushya! Dogtushya!

l8
00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:58.000
Ask her for a little, she will give you more

l9
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:09.500
They gave her rank, they gave her braid

l10
00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:15.000
They gave her half the floor

l11
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:20.500
She traded every one of them

l12
00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:32.000
For a biscuit and a walk at four
